{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/968664-speaking-instant-or-reflexive","id":968664,"title":"Speaking: Instant or Reflexive?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-13T12:08:43-07:00","id":968664,"title":"Speaking: Instant or Reflexive?","content":"Is barking orders in combat an instant action?<br /> Reflexive?<br /> <br /> If reflexive, does it cross over into instant after an arbitrary amount of words?<br /> Is this officially stated anywhere? If not, how do you run it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T12:18:11-07:00","id":968668,"title":"","content":"Presumably you're giving short orders, which would be reflexive. I could have sworn there was a suggestion about a certain amount of words but I'm sure even then it was the storyteller's decision on whether something was a quick reflexive barking or an action-long speech.<br /> <br /> Each turn is about three seconds long, so while I'd allow barking of orders I'd probably cut them off if they were yelling a running commentary during everyone else's turn. The first part got across and you can't go back. Reflexively, at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T13:17:49-07:00","id":968697,"title":"","content":"Rule of thumb, I'd say you can manage one (short, not run on) sentence per turn while also doing other actions. &quot;Help me get the pool table!&quot; is probably about the limit of what kind of tactical orders you can give reflexively. (incidentally also the best tactical order I ever gave)<br /> <br /> Time is flexible though, even in combat, and micromanaging player's conversations is probably not worth the effort unless they're really abusing the privilege. Combat has the unfortunate issue of taking place in more compacted time than normal while also using different rules and abilities, so I see a lot of head scratching from newer players when it breaks out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T13:58:24-07:00","id":968723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HelmsDerp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/968664-speaking-instant-or-reflexive?p=968697#post968697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rule of thumb, I'd say you can manage one (short, not run on) sentence per turn while also doing other actions. &quot;Help me get the pool table!&quot; is probably about the limit of what kind of tactical orders you can give reflexively. (incidentally also the best tactical order I ever gave)<br /> <br /> Time is flexible though, even in combat, and micromanaging player's conversations is probably not worth the effort unless they're really abusing the privilege.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly this. I play pretty fast and loose with the whole &quot;1 turn = 3 seconds&quot; thing, just as I do with the &quot;1 scene = 1 hour&quot; thing. So I just say talking is a reflexive action, and if it would take longer to say than it would to actually perform your action, you can't get it all out in one round. It's pretty rare that I have to enforce that though, usually players police themselves just fine when it comes to talking during combat turns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T14:37:30-07:00","id":968747,"title":"","content":"Well, <i>clearly</i> it's Reflexive unless the statement contains a number of words greater than or equal to your Wits+an appropriate <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/588705-complex-language-rules-whimsy\">Language</a>. Then it's Instant.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T00:25:47-07:00","id":969065,"title":"","content":"The root cause of the question was the Concentration Yantra in Mage, which breaks when taking a non-reflexive action. I was wondering if someone could talk while concentrating on a spell, but then realized that this has far broader implications, so I asked here instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T02:26:22-07:00","id":969100,"title":"","content":"To me - speaking is reflexive as long as no rolls are involved (then there's just the question how much you fit in a given turn). If you want to produce a roll (like Intimidation/etc) then it's Instant. <br /> As for mage concentration - I guess it's bet to ask in Mage for thaht","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T13:49:13-07:00","id":969432,"title":"","content":"I wouldnt have talking break concentration, personally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T16:41:40-07:00","id":969529,"title":"","content":"Reflexive, unless used as an attack (meaning it requires a roll), in which case I would generally argue it counts as your action.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T17:38:39-07:00","id":969556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/968664-speaking-instant-or-reflexive?p=969065#post969065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The root cause of the question was the Concentration Yantra in Mage, which breaks when taking a non-reflexive action. I was wondering if someone could talk while concentrating on a spell, but then realized that this has far broader implications, so I asked here instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's the difference between tactical chatter and <i>ominous magical chanting</i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> I misread which Yantra you were bringing up. I think saying a few words probably wouldn't break Concentration, unless you're actually <i>engaging</i> by doing so.<br /> <br /> So a distracted &quot;put it by the door&quot; works, &quot;wait, what are you doing here?&quot; probably wouldn't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T19:23:25-07:00","id":969608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/968664-speaking-instant-or-reflexive?p=969065#post969065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The root cause of the question was the Concentration Yantra in Mage, which breaks when taking a non-reflexive action. I was wondering if someone could talk while concentrating on a spell, but then realized that this has far broader implications, so I asked here instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>In this case I'd use this rule of thumb:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HelmsDerp</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rule of thumb, I'd say you can manage one (short, not run on) sentence per turn while also doing other actions. &quot;Help me get the pool table!&quot; is probably about the limit of what kind of tactical orders you can give reflexively. (incidentally also the best tactical order I ever gave)<br /> <br /> Time is flexible though, even in combat, and micromanaging player's conversations is probably not worth the effort unless they're really abusing the privilege. Combat has the unfortunate issue of taking place in more compacted time than normal while also using different rules and abilities, so I see a lot of head scratching from newer players when it breaks out.</div> </div> </div> </div>And if it was outside of combat I'd say short phrases with pauses is the speech pattern needed to focus on the spell, otherwise your focus shifts to talking. This has the benefit of making spell concentration conspicuous in conversation to help prevent abuse. I'd say it'd be possible to conceal that, possibly composure + subterfuge vs Wits + Empathy to notice if someone is intently focused on something .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 09-14-2016, 10:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}